sequenceDiagram
    participant Config
    participant DL as DataLoader
    participant SG as SignalGenerator
    participant FP as FilterPipeline
    participant RM as RiskManager
    participant TM as TradeManager
    participant TS as TradeSimulator
    participant Out as TradeResult
    
    Note over Config,Out: Contract-Based Pipeline Flow
    
    Config->>DL: DataConfig
    activate DL
    DL->>DL: Load OHLCV files
    DL->>DL: Validate & slice
    DL->>DL: Create DataBundle
    DL-->>SG: DataBundle
    deactivate DL
    
    activate SG
    SG->>SG: Compute indicators
    SG->>SG: Detect swing highs/lows
    SG->>SG: Create SignalFrame
    SG-->>FP: SignalFrame
    deactivate SG
    
    activate FP
    FP->>FP: Apply time filters
    FP->>FP: Apply technical filters
    FP->>FP: Create FilterResult
    FP-->>TS: FilterResult
    deactivate FP
    
    activate TS
    loop For each signal
        TS->>RM: Signal + Market Data
        activate RM
        RM->>RM: Calculate entry/SL/TP
        RM->>RM: Validate risk
        RM-->>TS: TradeParameters
        deactivate RM
        
        TS->>TM: Signal + TradeParameters
        activate TM
        TM->>TM: Check pyramiding rules
        TM->>TM: Check opposite signals
        TM-->>TS: TradeDecision
        deactivate TM
        
        alt Decision = OPEN
            TS->>TS: Create TradeEntry
            TS->>TS: Monitor LTF for exits
            TS->>TS: Create TradeExit (if hit)
            TS->>TS: Compose Trade
        else Decision = REJECT
            TS->>TS: Create RejectedSignal
        end
    end
    
    TS->>TS: Calculate statistics
    TS->>TS: Create TradeResult
    TS-->>Out: TradeResult
    deactivate TS
    
    Note over Out: trades: List[Trade]<br/>rejected_signals: List[RejectedSignal]<br/>win_rate, pnl, etc.